# Who approves what reaches the hub.
#
# With branch protection on `main` set to "Require review from Code Owners",
# nothing merges without one of these approving it. That is the approval in
# the submission process (CONTRIBUTING-TRAINERS.md): a trainer is imported as
# a pull request, and a leader's review of that pull request is what puts it on
# the hub.
#
# The hub's leaders are the repository's admins today. When the organisation
# makes a team for them, replace both names on every line with that team
# (for example @Project-Chimera-Hub/leaders).

